      "id": "https://www.atlasobscura.com/places/high-shoals-falls",
      "url": "https://www.atlasobscura.com/places/high-shoals-falls",
      "title": "[Atlas Obscura] High Shoals Falls  in Hiawassee, Georgia",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://img.atlasobscura.com/HlHvKFt4HsXRyeOTtEM-uwzi00fW-G7W6DEwRQGTuSU/rt:fit/w:600/c:1533:1022:nowe:0:520/q:81/sm:1/scp:1/ar:1/aHR0cHM6Ly9hdGxh/cy1kZXYuczMuYW1h/em9uYXdzLmNvbS91/cGxvYWRzL3BsYWNl/X2ltYWdlcy8wYTlh/MGJiYi02MjhlLTQ0/ZjYtOTBlZS1mM2Yy/Yzc3ZGY2OWI5Nzll/OGM5YTg3OGE5MTdl/MDhfSU1HXzI4ODQu/SlBFRw.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\n<p><img alt=\"High Shoals Falls\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://img.atlasobscura.com/QFag0m9aB-gW4nI4THOHypG_xmQybe7ey0pvLvA1mbQ/rs:fill:300:200:1/g:ce/c:1533:1022:nowe:0:520/q:81/sm:1/scp:1/ar:1/aHR0cHM6Ly9hdGxh/cy1kZXYuczMuYW1h/em9uYXdzLmNvbS91/cGxvYWRzL3BsYWNl/X2ltYWdlcy8wYTlh/MGJiYi02MjhlLTQ0/ZjYtOTBlZS1mM2Yy/Yzc3ZGY2OWI5Nzll/OGM5YTg3OGE5MTdl/MDhfSU1HXzI4ODQu/SlBFRw.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></p> <p>High Shoals Falls is a secluded waterfall. To get there you must access the trailhead on Indian Grave Gap Rd in Hiawassee, Ga. The drive up the mountain is exhilarating.</p>\n<p>Once you reach the trailhead, you begin descending the mountain. The trail leads you down into a small valley with beautiful scenery and several back country campsites.</p>\n<p>There are two waterfalls on the trail. The first one is Blue Hole Falls, the smaller of the two.</p>\n<p>The trail ends at High Shoals Falls where there is a boardwalk to view the falls from. The hike is a moderately challenging 2.4 miles round trip and worth every step. </p>",
